# Build-time secrets for the KaChat desktop app. Copy this file to `.env` and fill in the values;
# Vite inlines every VITE_-prefixed var into the built bundle at `npm run build` / `npm run dev`.
# `.env` is gitignored (see .gitignore) so keys never land in the public source — this mirrors
# iOS's Secrets.xcconfig and Android's local.properties. Anyone inspecting the *shipped* bundle
# can still read the inlined value, exactly as they could extract it from the store-app binaries.

# ChangeNOW API key that powers the Swaps tab. Get one free at https://changenow.io/api.
# When present, swaps work out of the box with nothing for the user to paste. A device-level
# localStorage override ("kachat-changenow-api-key-v1") still takes precedence if set.
VITE_CHANGENOW_API_KEY=your-changenow-api-key-here
